    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676550/extras/2f7f04bea82317f20bcf946b31044697.avif?t=1748509934\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isles of Rain, a 3rd Person Adventure set on melancholy Islands where it always rains. The game sees you play as The Little Sailor, a stranded individual who finds themselves stuck on the Isles of Rain. Explore each Isle to uncover the story and find hidden secrets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676550/extras/a2d584b5fe4142c62512653d15aac51b.avif?t=1748509934\" width=600 height=100 /></span>As The Little Sailor you will travel across the different islands that make up the Isles. On your adventure you will meet various characters who you can choose to help and complete tasks for. Helping these character may help The Little Sailor return to their home island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676550/extras/9193e039d7eadf5526ac33c77d94c9f9.avif?t=1748509934\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Across the Islands you may find items. These items may help you solve puzzles to further your adventure on the Isles of Rain. Explore the Isles by moving and jumping around to gain acess to new areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player cozy wholesome 3rd person platformer. Set on melancholy Islands where it always rains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the islands and take in the cozy vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run and jump around to navigate the terrain of each Isle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles across the Isles to further your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Tasks for characters you meet on your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a single developer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676550/extras/2f7f04bea82317f20bcf946b31044697.avif?t=1748509934\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isles of Rain, a 3rd Person Adventure set on melancholy Islands where it always rains. The game sees you play as The Little Sailor, a stranded individual who finds themselves stuck on the Isles of Rain. Explore each Isle to uncover the story and find hidden secrets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676550/extras/a2d584b5fe4142c62512653d15aac51b.avif?t=1748509934\" width=600 height=100 /></span>As The Little Sailor you will travel across the different islands that make up the Isles. On your adventure you will meet various characters who you can choose to help and complete tasks for. Helping these character may help The Little Sailor return to their home island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676550/extras/9193e039d7eadf5526ac33c77d94c9f9.avif?t=1748509934\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Across the Islands you may find items. These items may help you solve puzzles to further your adventure on the Isles of Rain. Explore the Isles by moving and jumping around to gain acess to new areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player cozy wholesome 3rd person platformer. Set on melancholy Islands where it always rains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the islands and take in the cozy vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run and jump around to navigate the terrain of each Isle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles across the Isles to further your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Tasks for characters you meet on your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a single developer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
